# Build output. NOTE: `/constitution` (no slash) would also ignore this repo's
# own dogfood constitution/ directory (implementation-plan.md §2.11), so it is
# re-included below. A root FILE named `constitution` cannot exist anyway now —
# it would collide with the directory — so only the .exe artifact matters.
/constitution
!/constitution/
/constitution.exe
/dist/

# Go test/coverage artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt
coverage.html

# testscript scratch dirs (created under $WORK, but guard against accidents)
/testdata/*.tmp

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
